packed
/.github/pack-content/target

# Output of the packaging tool, which the validation workflow builds and which
# is easy to leave behind after running the same commands by hand.
/content.zip
/content.sha256
/first.zip
/first.sha256

# Editor leftovers. One of these — a Script.c~ holding a superseded revision of
# a Lightning definition — was committed in the initial import and shipped to
# every client inside content.zip until it was noticed.
*~
*.orig
*.rej
*.bak
*.swp
